WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,074 --> 00:00:03,152
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:03,202 --> 00:00:05,312
This is Episode 49.

3
00:00:05,362 --> 00:00:06,616
Night time.

4
00:00:06,666 --> 00:00:08,261
Maya is asleep.

5
00:00:08,311 --> 00:00:10,917
A muddy blob climbs over the back wall.

6
00:00:10,967 --> 00:00:12,523
The wrong way in.

7
00:00:12,573 --> 00:00:13,691
Oh no!

8
00:00:13,741 --> 00:00:15,686
But the watch owl is awake.

9
00:00:15,736 --> 00:00:18,119
Its head turns all the way around.

10
00:00:18,169 --> 00:00:19,822
It sees everything.

11
00:00:19,872 --> 00:00:21,797
The blob tries the door.

12
00:00:21,847 --> 00:00:22,897
Rattle.

13
00:00:22,947 --> 00:00:24,015
Again.

14
00:00:24,065 --> 00:00:25,096
Rattle.

15
00:00:25,146 --> 00:00:26,214
Again.

16
00:00:26,264 --> 00:00:27,782
The owl counts.

17
00:00:27,832 --> 00:00:28,804
One.

18
00:00:28,854 --> 00:00:29,767
Two.

19
00:00:29,817 --> 00:00:30,789
Three.

20
00:00:30,839 --> 00:00:32,395
That is strange.

21
00:00:32,445 --> 00:00:33,417
Hoot!

22
00:00:33,467 --> 00:00:34,915
The bell rings.

23
00:00:34,965 --> 00:00:36,414
Maya wakes up.

24
00:00:36,464 --> 00:00:37,514
Broom!

25
00:00:37,564 --> 00:00:39,304
The blob rolls away.

26
00:00:39,354 --> 00:00:40,462
Morning.

27
00:00:40,512 --> 00:00:42,613
Friends come up the front path.

28
00:00:42,663 --> 00:00:44,180
The owl nods.

29
00:00:44,230 --> 00:00:45,445
No hoot.

30
00:00:45,495 --> 00:00:47,021
Friends are fine.

31
00:00:47,071 --> 00:00:48,812
The owl knows normal.

32
00:00:48,862 --> 00:00:50,827
The owl spots strange.

33
00:00:50,877 --> 00:00:52,578
That is the watch owl.

34
00:00:52,628 --> 00:00:54,515
Now you know GuardDuty!

35
00:00:54,565 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
